{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15470","headline":"奉赠苗员外 · 李端","name":"奉赠苗员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朱户敞高扉，青槐碍落晖。\n八龙承庆重，三虎递朝归。\n坐竹人声绝，横琴鸟语稀。\n花慙潘岳貌，年称老莱衣。\n叶暗新樱熟，丝长粉蝶飞。\n应怜鲁儒贱，空与故山违。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15470.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15470","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}